---
3md: "1.0"
axis: "layer"
title: "Grove"
---

@plane z=0 label="Ground"
The forest floor. A game can parent its ground nodes here.

@plane z=1 label="Canopy"
Birds and light. This plane is another layer, not a Godot node.

@plane z=2 label="HUD"
Health and the map. The addon does not instance a CanvasLayer.
